697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","color":"ff7766","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1752040694,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzUyMDQwNjk0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:navigation","name":"topic:navigation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-01-22T14:35:23Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T10:41:59Z","closed_at":"2025-05-02T08:18:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101915","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101915","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101915.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101915.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This PR provides a way for user to control which point needs to be processed or skipped by AStar2D/3D classes.\r\nThis can be used for various effects, including simulation of `DiagonalMode` from `AStarGrid2D`.\r\n\r\nFor example, if that AStar2D represents a 2D grid of the 256x256 dimension, the solution to orthogonal movement would look like this:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends AStar2D\r\nclass_name AStarTest\r\n\r\nvar size = 256 # use your array dimension\r\n\r\nfunc _filter_neighbor(from_id: int, neighbor_id: int) -> bool:\r\n\tvar fx = from_id % size\r\n\tvar fy = from_id / size\r\n\t\r\n\tvar nx = neighbor_id % size\r\n\tvar ny = neighbor_id / size\r\n\t\r\n\tif fx == nx || fy == ny: # only orthogonal movement is enabled (even if diagonals are connected).\r\n\t\treturn false # allow this point\r\n\t\r\n\treturn true # skip this point\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Chaosus","id":3036176,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzYxNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101915/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101915/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}